      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Chain 6, join with a slip stitch to form a ring. Round 1: ch 1, work 10 dc into the ring, join with a slip stitch." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Petals (make 5)" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "For each petal: skip 1 dc of the ring, chain 4, work 6 trebles over this chain, chain 4, slip stitch into the next dc of the ring. Repeat 4 more times for 5 petals total." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Finishing" }]
